WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:10.000
Type a character. Nanoodle paints it, and Idol Max turns it into a textured 3D model.

00:00:10.000 --> 00:00:15.000
It also adds a skeleton and skin weights, so the model can move.

00:00:15.000 --> 00:00:21.500
And it comes with walk, run, jump and idle clips, all from one picture.

00:00:21.500 --> 00:00:25.550
Turbo, on the right, costs half as much and keeps more of the felt texture.
